  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of RELAP is to improve the resilience and incomes of rural producers&#xbf; households in the West Bank. The development objective is to increase climate resilience, land productivity, agricultural production and marketing opportunities for smallholders and landless rural poor people.</narrative>
